  "Solution": "To translate 2 units to the left, replace \\(x\\) with \\(x+2\\), giving \\(y=(x+2)^2\\). Then, to translate 3 units downward, subtract 3 from the whole expression, giving \\(y=(x+2)^2-3\\).",
